@sleep 2
ttl story expect TtlBotSagaL act 5 yes
# An unawakened visitor enters the real hall through a solo booking before Act VI.
execute as TtlBotSagaL run ttl arena join walpurgis
@sleep 2
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotSagaL in
execute as TtlBotSagaL run ttl arena leave
@sleep 2
ttl walpurgis expect TtlBotSagaL out
ftbquests change_progress TtlBotSagaL complete 641D39B5FFE38B84
